e": 8.7}, {"text": "still dark outside...my son", "x": 7.32, "y": 92.22, "w": 18.08, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "waiting behind me.", "x": 7.28, "y": 93.48, "w": 13.21, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "W e shared a secret.", "x": 29.94, "y": 83.51, "w": 13.92, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "A moment later Christien woke", "x": 30.03, "y": 85.98, "w": 21.32, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "up with a yawn: \"Don't tell me", "x": 30.09, "y": 87.24, "w": 20.46, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "he saw a UFO.\"", "x": 30.09, "y": 88.5, "w": 10.83, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "She did not see the smile", "x": 30.09, "y": 90.97, "w": 17.55, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "across my face.", "x": 30.06, "y": 92.2, "w": 11.07, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "Jan Blei, January 2004, Holland", "x": 34.37, "y": 94.86, "w": 16.99, "h": 0.97, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "Wales 2003", "x": 54.64, "y": 69.35, "w": 8.31, "h": 2.3, "fontSize": 13.9}, {"text": "On 2 October last year this won-", "x": 54.64, "y": 71.18, "w": 18.28, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "derful picture was captured by a", "x": 54.55, "y": 72.29, "w": 18.46, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "Welsh schoolboy. He impressed", "x": 54.61, "y": 73.4, "w": 18.49, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "NASA after taking an amazing", "x": 54.67, "y": 74.51, "w": 17.24, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "picture of what seems to be a", "x": 54.58, "y": 75.61, "w": 16.75, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "meteor while he was out skate-", "x": 54.67, "y": 76.72, "w": 17.42, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "boarding.", "x": 54.67, "y": 77.83, "w": 5.51, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "Fifteen-year-old Jonathan Burnett", "x": 54.73, "y": 80.02, "w": 19.1, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "snapped the fiery ball as he was", "x": 54.67, "y": 81.13, "w": 18.52, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "taking photos of his mates doing", "x": 54.7, "y": 82.24, "w": 18.56, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "skate stunts.", "x": 54.64, "y": 83.35, "w": 7.41, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "He rushed to his home in South", "x": 54.7, "y": 85.52, "w": 18.22, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "Wales to show his parents and", "x": 54.64, "y": 86.58, "w": 17.7, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "later Emailed it to NASA. They're", "x": 54.7, "y": 87.65, "w": 18.85, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "now trying to decide exactly what", "x": 54.67, "y": 88.71, "w": 19.0, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "it is.", "x": 54.73, "y": 89.78, "w": 2.42, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "Jonathan first thought it was just", "x": 54.67, "y": 92.08, "w": 18.39, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "the sun reflecting off the clouds.", "x": 54.67, "y": 93.19, "w": 18.15, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "He took two photos, one of the", "x": 75.57, "y": 82.32, "w": 17.66, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "'meteor' hurtling through the", "x": 75.48, "y": 83.41, "w": 16.19, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "earth's atmosphere and one of it", "x": 75.45, "y": 84.5, "w": 18.7, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "disintegrating and leaving a burn-", "x": 75.51, "y": 85.58, "w": 18.77, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "ing trail.", "x": 75.57, "y": 86.67, "w": 4.62, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "But NASA experts can't agree", "x": 75.6, "y": 88.91, "w": 17.2, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "exactly what it is yet. Apart from a", "x": 75.57, "y": 89.97, "w": 19.32, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "meteor, they say it could be a", "x": 75.54, "y": 91.04, "w": 17.03, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "plane's trail or maybe something", "x": 75.57, "y": 92.1, "w": 18.59, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "even more unusual...", "x": 75.57, "y": 93.17, "w": 12.21, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "AR", "x": 94.74, "y": 97.52, "w": 1.66, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "\"Well Dad\"?", "x": 29.97, "y": 63.34, "w": 8.5, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "With an", "x": 29.97, "y": 64.6, "w": 5.5, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "early morn-", "x": 29.91, "y": 65.86, "w": 7.81, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "ing grin I", "x": 30.03, "y": 67.11, "w": 6.26, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "turned my", "x": 30.0, "y": 68.37, "w": 7.18, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "face to the", "x": 29.94, "y": 69.63, "w": 7.48, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "boy. \"You", "x": 30.0, "y": 70.88, "w": 6.69, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "were right", "x": 29.97, "y": 72.14, "w": 7.17, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "lad.\" Slowly", "x": 30.06, "y": 73.4, "w": 8.22, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "we went up", "x": 29.97, "y": 74.65, "w": 8.09, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "the stairs, he", "x": 29.97, "y": 75.91, "w": 9.14, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "put his little hand in mine and", "x": 30.06, "y": 77.17, "w": 20.37, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "suddenly I realized our rela-", "x": 30.03, "y": 78.42, "w": 18.99, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "tionship would never be the", "x": 30.0, "y": 79.68, "w": 19.27, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "same.", "x": 30.03, "y": 80.94, "w": 4.23, "h": 1.18, "fontSize": 8.7}]}